id: E2175
trigger_tool: cmake
phase: testing
error_signature: qrencode CTest inventory differs when optional PNG or Iconv backends are auto-enabled|settings.os.version value not defined
severity: 2
category: build-system,cmake,detection,testing
match_keywords: WITH_TOOLS,WITHOUT_PNG,WITH_TESTS,PNG::PNG,ICONV::ICONV,CTest inventory
title: CMake optional backend switches must be frozen before counting upstream tests
root_cause: qrencode conditionally adds PNG tool tests and Iconv decoder tests; leaving defaults to host discovery changes the built CTest denominator across Linux, Windows and OHOS. The local OHOS Conan profile also requires an explicit settings.os.version before package graph validation.
affected_scope: CMake libraries whose upstream tests and utilities are guarded by optional find_package results.
verification_cmd: Configure with WITH_TOOLS=OFF, WITHOUT_PNG=ON, WITH_TESTS=ON; read ctest -N and execute the exact resulting list.
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: freeze-optional-backends
rec_description: Explicitly set optional backend and test switches in CMakeToolchain, then inventory ctest -N from the configured build tree before running tests.
rec_command: cmake -DWITH_TOOLS=OFF -DWITHOUT_PNG=ON -DWITH_TESTS=ON; ctest -N; ctest --output-on-failure
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: cmake-explicit-option-test-inventory
forbid_1_pattern: WITH_TOOLS=ON without PNG closure|ctest denominator inferred from source only
forbid_1_reason: Host package discovery can add or remove tests and cause an unverifiable or incomplete denominator.
forbid_1_consequence: CI and local results cannot be compared; hidden optional tests may be skipped.
principles: []
causes: []
caused_by: []
similar_to: E368
conflicts_with: []
prerequisite_of: []
